<title>FRANCE: Carrefour sees 96 pre-tax, pre-excep up.</title>
<headline>Carrefour sees 96 pre-tax, pre-excep up.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailer Carrefour said it expected to show an increase in pre-tax, pre-exceptional profit for 1996 of around 20 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;The group's turnover should be more than 155 billion francs, excluding taxes. The rise in the attributable pre-tax, pre-exceptional profit should be around 20 percent,&quot; it said in a statement detailing its first-half 1996 results.</p>
</text>
